        {
          "type": "reading",
          "text_en": "Hadramout is a big region in the east of Yemen. It has two very different parts: the coast and the valley. On the coast, there are cities like Mukalla and Al-Shihr. The weather there is hot and humid, and the sea is blue and beautiful. The valley is far from the sea. Seiyun, Shibam and Tarim are in the valley. The weather is dry. It is very hot in summer, but it is cold at night in winter. In the valley, there are old mud houses and tall palm trees. The streets in old Tarim are narrow and quiet. Mukalla is a busy city with new buildings and fast cars, but the valley is calm and slow.",
